# Contributing Guide
Thank you for your interest in contributing to this open-source project!

## How to Contribute
1. Fork this repository
2. Create your feature branch
3. Commit your changes
4. Push to the branch
5. Create a Pull Request

## Contribution Rules
- Follow unified code style and specification
- Update documents synchronously for new functions
- No invalid or malicious submission
- All contributions will be manually reviewed by the primary maintainer

## Issue Rules
- Use official templates to submit bugs and feature requests
- Describe problems clearly and completely
- Avoid duplicate and invalid issues
